 href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Hoarfrost_Herald_of_the_Bitter_Ice.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Hoarfrost_Herald_of_the_Bitter_Ice.png/420px-Hoarfrost_Herald_of_the_Bitter_Ice.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"546\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Hoarfrost_Herald_of_the_Bitter_Ice.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Crack upon the frozen beaches, the storm itself within.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">Image of completed version<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Hoarfrost,_Herald_of_the_Bitter_Ice_(Completed).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowik